  - crash/sanitizer/timeout classified distinctly from wrong-output
  - stdout compared exactly; stderr matched by class(empty/nonempty) plus an
    optional regex, because the prompts specify which conditions are diagnosed
    rather than the exact wording
  - stdin delivered as both a pipe and a redirected regular file
  - parallel across cases
  - suite files may be plain .json or gzipped .json.gz, transparently

